  junhoyeo/tokscale
  https://github.com/junhoyeo/tokscale
  pinned to commit 1ec865d4e9e5adf157efb9f5c2dfaf29630d71e5

Tokscale provides the multi-client local session parsers, scanners, aggregation
primitives, canonical model normalization, and pricing engine used by this
rewrite. No raw session content is intentionally uploaded by Token Monitor;
only normalized aggregate statistics generated locally are included in the
encrypted device ledger.
